So no matter where you
run your application,

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.790
you now have a consistent,
accessible APM tool

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.300
kit to monitor and manage
the performance of your apps.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.550
BRYAN ZIMMERMAN: With
Stackdriver Trace, Profiler

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:56.730
and Debugger, APM enables
developers and operators

00:03:56.730 --> 00:03:59.100
